{
	"id": "projects",
	"node": "projects",
	"engine": "n8n",
	"credential": {
		"name": "projectsApi",
		"properties": ["apiKey"],
		"data": {
			"apiKey": "{{secret}}"
		},
		"secretPrefix": "prj_"
	},
	"prompt": [
		"Build an n8n node for the Projects API. Read its docs first: `curl -s http://127.0.0.1:18090/projects/docs`.",
		"The API runs locally. Use the sandbox key from the docs for your tests.",
		"",
		"A grader checks these names exactly:",
		"- Node name `projects`, display name \"Projects\".",
		"- Credential name `projectsApi` with one field `apiKey` (a password field). The credential sends the key the way the docs say.",
		"- Operation `project.get` (\"Get a project\"). Field: `project` (required), a resource locator with three modes: `list` (a searchable list of the projects that shows the project name and stores the project ID), `id` (the project ID), and `url` (the project URL, `https://app.projects.test/p/<id>`). Emit the project as the API returns it.",
		"",
		"{{format}}",
		"",
		"Work in the current directory. Dependencies are installed: do not install packages. Do not ask questions.",
		"Stop when the node builds, passes the format checks, and works against the API."
	],
	"cases": [
		{
			"id": "get-by-id",
			"operation": "project.get",
			"input": {
				"project": {
					"__rl": true,
					"mode": "id",
					"value": "pj_3a95"
				}
			},
			"expect": {
				"items": [
					{
						"id": "pj_3a95",
						"name": "Beta project 2",
						"createdAt": "2026-05-02T00:00:00.000Z"
					}
				],
				"requests": {
					"method": "GET",
					"path": "/projects/v1/projects/pj_3a95",
					"count": 1
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "get-by-url",
			"operation": "project.get",
			"input": {
				"project": {
					"__rl": true,
					"mode": "url",
					"value": "https://app.projects.test/p/pj_3b2a"
				}
			},
			"expect": {
				"items": [
					{
						"id": "pj_3b2a",
						"name": "Gamma project 3",
						"createdAt": "2026-05-03T00:00:00.000Z"
					}
				],
				"requests": {
					"method": "GET",
					"path": "/projects/v1/projects/pj_3b2a",
					"count": 1
				}
			}
		},
		{
